Fixed the a11y gap in `mobile/src/safety/ReportSheet.tsx`: the captured screenshot `<Image>` had no accessibility treatment, so screen readers would announce a bare, uninformative "Image". Marked it decorative (`accessible={false}`, `importantForAccessibility="no"`) since its context is already conveyed by the visible `mobile.live.reportSub` text above it — no new i18n keys needed. `tsc --noEmit` is clean for this file. RESULT written to `tasks/admin-queue/done/149-report-sheet-screenshot-a11y-RESULT.md`.
